# Difference world
-/

World "Difference"
Title "Difference World"
Image "images/world-difference.svg"

Introduction
"If `A` and `B` are sets, then the *difference* `A \\ B` is the set of objects that are elements
of `A` but not elements of `B`.  In this world you'll prove theorems about differences, and at
the end you'll meet the *symmetric difference* of two sets.
"
